//api.github.com/users/yinsn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","state":"uploaded","size":902,"digest":"sha256:b03b2fb8e960d3074cb2e9b058c42b8fd0cda7ce3ea863fd3969d8421ea96e1e","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-25T04:43:10Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T04:43:10Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/releases/download/v0.4.7/UPDATE.zh-CN.txt"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/tarball/v0.4.7","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/zipball/v0.4.7","body":"# 释手 0.4.7\n\n本次修正录音期间键鼠操作导致上屏被过早拦截的问题，并增加可见反馈。\n\n- 录音期间可点击、按键和切换输入位置；按下结束键时，才确定当时的输入框。请在结束时把光标放在希望输入的位置。\n- 结束后等待回填期间，若再次操作键鼠、切换目标或无法确认位置，仍停止自动输入，避免回填到已改变的位置。\n- 自动输入未执行或结果未确认时，显示约 3 秒的短提示，说明文字已复制或可从释手记录找回。提示不抢焦点、不拦鼠标，新录音开始时立即恢复录音提示。\n- 微信、Codex 等应用继续使用 0.4.6 的通用粘贴链路；模型、F16／脚踏板和个人词库沿用。\n\n在「设置 → 关于释手 → 检查更新」升级即可，无需重新下载模型。\n"}
